{"product_id":"footprints-memoirs-of-an-indian-patriarch","title":"FOOTPRINTS: MEMOIRS OF AN INDIAN PATRIARCH","description":"\u003cp\u003eAn insight into the life of a successful entrepreneur and a towering stalwart of the Indian community. This autobiography of Maghanmal J. Pancholia provides an insight into the life of a successful entrepreneur and a towering stalwart of the Indian community. The book traces the foundations on which he built the family business – a successful platform for the future generations. The author travels back in time to walk through the alleys of his beloved Thatta in undivided India. Interspersed with anecdotes, this is also a kaleidoscope of Dubai's growth from a quiet coastal town to a bustling city.\u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:0 x 0  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Maghanmal J. Pancholia \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9781860632655 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format:  \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 310\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44687752429721,"sku":"15RB-3-9781860632655","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/5c776ba9d8ce7f488d899026c5da27ee.jpg?v=1722258277","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/footprints-memoirs-of-an-indian-patriarch","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}